      "value": "<p>When you would normally roll one or more dice to restore Hit Points to a creature with a spell or Channel Divinity, don't roll those dice for the healing; instead use the highest number possible for each die. For example, instead of restoring 2d6 Hit Points to a creature with a spell, you restore 12.</p><section id=\"secret-1Bw7MOem4xyPO17q\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature does not automate the maximizing of all of your rolls.</p></section>",
